                            <p>
                                Recent updates enhance web development work=
flows with better code assistance, smarter documentation, and smoother tool=
 integration. Experimental support for the new TypeScript-Go language serve=
r is now available, offering faster and more accurate assistance for TypeSc=
ript projects.
