ly in large-scale and enterprise projects. With IntelliJ IDEA 2025.2, we=E2=
=80=99re proud to introduce native support through the official JetBrains B=
azel plugin, now generally available. Bazel becomes a first-class citizen i=
n IntelliJ IDEA, with deep integration for Java, Kotlin, Scala, Python, and=
 Go. You get accurate target-to-module mapping, high performance, and a cle=
ar UX, on all operating systems.
                            </p>
                            <p>
                                If your team relies on Bazel, this release =
removes friction and aligns perfectly with your development workflows. Lear=
n more in
                                <a href=3D"https://blog.jetbrains.com/idea/=
2025/07/bazel-ga-release/" class=3D"rs-link rs-link_external" target=3D"_bl=
ank" data-cl=3D"true">this article</a>.
